Changes made in Pulsession:
- Added a session monitor for PI-Desktop, Claude Code and Codex sessions
  (Sources/Pulse/Sessions/, Sources/Pulse/Settings/SessionsSettingsView.swift,
  Tests/PulseTests/SessionMonitorTests.swift, Docs/sessions.md), wired into
  the existing panel, settings, store and app delegate at commented seams.
- Changed the app's identity: bundle identifier io.github.jasperhan.pulsession,
  URL scheme pulsession://, storage in ~/Library/Application Support/Pulsession,
  and no Sparkle update feed.
- Renamed the product in user-facing strings, rewrote the English and
  Simplified Chinese READMEs, and removed the other README translations and
  upstream's appcast.xml.

